        "content": "## 🔴 MANUAL CREDENTIALS\n- **Supabase** (`supabaseApi`, secret key): `3 Log Failure` → `outreach_failures`.\n- Redacts email-shaped substrings and caps the message at 200 chars before any write.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 3
      },
